# Belt and braces. `npm run pack` builds the bundle from a staged allowlist in
# dist-mcpb/, so nothing here should ever match — but `mcpb pack` run by hand
# against the repo root would otherwise sweep up a live Canvas session cookie.
#
# Patterns are root-anchored on purpose: a bare `src/` would also delete
# `node_modules/zod/src/`, quietly shipping a broken dependency.
/.env
/.env.*
/*.env
/.git/
/.github/
/.claude/
/docs/
/src/
/scripts/
/dist-mcpb/
/*.mcpb
node_modules/.cache/
node_modules/.bin/
*.tsbuildinfo
